163 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The LOCO-Hazard Detection Helmet is a pioneering smart safety solution developed to enhance protection and reduce risks in hazardous work environments such as construction sites, mining zones, and industrial areas. Utilizing the power of an ESP32 microcontroller, the helmet integrates a DHT11 sensor for continuous monitoring of temperature and humidity, along with a GPS NEO-6M module for precise real-time location tracking. In the event of a hazard, the system triggers immediate alerts through buzzers and displays the status on an LCD screen, ensuring workers are instantly aware of any dangerous conditions. Additionally, the helmet is connected to a Telegram bot system, which automatically transmits emergency messages and live GPS coordinates to pre-assigned emergency contacts, enabling rapid external support and coordination. A unique component of this solution is the inclusion of a dedicated Safety Patrol Service \(SPS\), consisting of 7 to 10 personnel, responsible for continuously monitoring field workers and providing timely interventions during critical situations. This not only elevates the overall safety framework but also contributes to employment generation through new supervisory roles. By combining real-time environmental sensing, automated emergency communication, and human oversight, the LOCO-Hazard Detection Helmet offers a comprehensive, scalable, and proactive approach to occupational safety, setting a new standard in safeguarding lives in high-risk industries.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
