/T (Moreover, the SPS is not limited to just responding to emergencies. The team is also responsible for monitoring overall worker safety on-site, ensuring that workers are not exposed to avoidable risks. This proactive oversight helps in preventing accidents before they occur, fostering a culture of safety and well- being in high-risk environments. The SPS can make real-time adjustments to safety protocols based on live data from the helmets, ensuring the workplace remains as safe as possible.)
