/T (The SPS team also provides a vital support system in situations where workers may be unable to communicate effectively, either due to unconsciousness, injury, or being in a high-noise environment. By using the GPS coordinates from the helmet, the SPS can quickly locate the worker, even in situations where other communication methods might fail, ensuring that timely assistance is provided when it is most needed.)
/E (The SPS team also provides a vital support system in situations where workers may be unable to communicate effectively, either due to unconsciousness, injury, or being in a high-noise environment. By using the GPS coordinates from the helmet, the SPS can quickly locate the worker, even in situations where other communication methods might fail, ensuring that timely assistance is provided when it is most needed.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
